  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDGs and Agenda 2030, UNDP - SDGs in BiH &amp; Agenda 2030</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SDGs och Agenda 2030, UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser att hj&#xE4;lpa Bosnien och Hercegovina att definiera och implementera SDG-m&#xE5;len / 2030-Agendan till handling genom att samla relevanta partner kring SDG &#x201D;Roadmap&#x201D; - en agenda med en tydlig vision f&#xF6;r landet.

Projektet har f&#xF6;r syfte att bygga kapacitet och f&#xF6;rbereda privata och offentliga partners i Bosnien och Hercegovina f&#xF6;r genomf&#xF6;randet av SDGs, med tv&#xE5; f&#xF6;ljande effektm&#xE5;l:
1. SDGs &#x201D;Roadmap&#x201D; f&#xF6;r BiH utvecklas och att genomf&#xF6;randet p&#xE5;b&#xF6;rjades.
2. att privat sektor akt&#xF6;rer &#xE4;r sensibiliserad och engagerad i SDGs prioritering, planering och genomf&#xF6;rande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to capacitate and prepare private and public sector partners in Bosnia and Herzegovina for the SDGs implementation, thus directly supporting Bosnia and Herzegovina&#x2019;s efforts to contribute to the largest global agenda that exists today &#x2013; Agenda 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Goal of the intervention is that Bosnia and Herzegovina translates Agenda 2030 into action for the benefit of all its citizens. The Project Outcome is as follows: Public and private sector partners prepared for implementation of the SDGs in Bosnia and Herzegovina.

The project aims to capacitate and prepare private and public sector partners in Bosnia and Herzegovina for the SDGs implementation, thus directly supporting Bosnia and Herzegovina&#xB4;s efforts to contribute to the largest global agenda that exists today  Agenda 2030. The project envisages two outputs as follows:
1. SDG Roadmap for Bosnia and Herzegovina developed, and implementation started.
2. Private sector actors sensitized and engaged in SDGs prioritization, planning and implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
